WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.487
Particle i checks every neighbour's key.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.170
Each projection is a score.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.917
Softmax weights sum to one, shown as edge brightness.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.755
Next, B hides in A's shadow.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.988
A pair bias lowers B's weight ratio.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.567
Remove A, the ratio returns. A plain sum cannot shield.
